cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the following."
title: "sphalerite-equilibrium-mc: replica-exchange evidence against a dilute indium solid solution in sphalerite"
abstract: >-
  Replica-exchange Monte Carlo study of indium in sphalerite, establishing that
  the equilibrium state is condensed rather than a dilute solid solution at every
  composition from 0.10 to 2.00 atomic per cent. Includes the adaptive ladder
  construction, the bracketing test that establishes the result without requiring
  convergence at ore-forming temperatures, the ladder scaling law, verification
  to 5e5 cation sites, and the structure generation and fitting harness for the
  deferred first-principles parameterisation.
